        "Copy fingerprint"
  <p className="note note--warn" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "Read this fingerprint back to your therapist (in the room or on the phone). If it does not match what their portal shows, STOP — a mismatch means the key was substituted."
  <label className="checkbox">
    <input checked=true className="checkbox__input" type="checkbox">
    <span aria-hidden="true" className="checkbox__box">
      <span className="checkbox__check">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height=13 stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth=1.8 viewBox="0 0 24 24" width=13>
          <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5">
    <span>
      "We read the key fingerprint back to each other and it MATCHED. (A substituted key would decrypt nothing — but checking is the only proof the right therapist is on the other end.)"
  <label className="checkbox">
    <input checked=true className="checkbox__input" type="checkbox">
    <span aria-hidden="true" className="checkbox__box">
      <span className="checkbox__check">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height=13 stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth=1.8 viewBox="0 0 24 24" width=13>
          <path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5">
    <span>
      "I understand: they can read my patterns and the decrypted entries behind them; every read is audit-logged; revoking ends access immediately but cannot unread what has already been seen."
  <button className="btn" disabled=false type="button">
    <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" focusable="false" height=17 stroke="currentColor" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth=1.8 viewBox="0 0 24 24" width=17>
      <circle cx="18" cy="5.5" r="2.4">
      <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="2.4">
      <circle cx="18" cy="18.5" r="2.4">
      <path d="M8.2 10.8l7.6-4.1">
      <path d="M8.2 13.2l7.6 4.1">
    "Confirm and share"
  <div className="banner banner--error" role="alert">
    "The vault is locked — unlock again first."
<section className="card">
  <h2 className="card__title">
    "Your grants"
  <p className="note" style={"whiteSpace":"pre-wrap"}>
    "No active grants — your journal is shared with no one.""
`;

